# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat0.rpy:6
translate italian cafechat0_6189c630:

    # "I hang around the café for a while, looking for somebody who might be up for a chat."
    "Mi fermo un po’ al bar, alla ricerca di qualcuno con cui fare due chiacchiere."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat0.rpy:8
translate italian cafechat0_a701de0e:

    # "Eventually, a cute woman comes in and sits by herself, working on her laptop."
    "Alla fine, entra una ragazza carina e si siede da sola, lavorando al suo portatile."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat0.rpy:9
translate italian cafechat0_87d5764a:

    # "I decide that she's the one and walk up to her."
    "Decido che è lei quella giusta e mi avvicino."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat0.rpy:10
translate italian cafechat0_b5117939:

    # "She glances up at me as I approach, and gives me an annoyed look."
    "Mi lancia un’occhiata mentre mi avvicino e mi fa uno sguardo infastidito."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat0.rpy:11
translate italian cafechat0_d7cfad11:

    # "I don't let that stop me though. I continue up towards her."
    "Non mi lascio scoraggiare, però. Continuo ad avvicinarmi."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat0.rpy:12
translate italian cafechat0_f2795711:

    # pc "Uh, hello."
    pc "Ehm, ciao."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat0.rpy:13
translate italian cafechat0_ef39114d:

    # pc "I just noticed you from across the café. I love your hair."
    pc "Ti ho appena notata dall’altra parte del bar. Adoro i tuoi capelli."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat0.rpy:14
translate italian cafechat0_944c8247:

    # "Woman" "Yeah, hold on a second, babe, there's some jerk here trying to talk to me."
    "Woman" "Sì, aspetta un attimo, tesoro, c’è un idiota qui che sta cercando di parlarmi."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat0.rpy:16
translate italian cafechat0_ef7a4ba1:

    # "She looks up at me and points to the bluetooth headset that's in her ear."
    "Mi guarda e indica l’auricolare Bluetooth che ha nell’orecchio."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat0.rpy:17
translate italian cafechat0_3193f415:

    # "Woman" "Hey, I'm kinda busy here, guy."
    "Woman" "Ehi, sono un po’ occupata qui, ragazzo."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat0.rpy:18
translate italian cafechat0_b2b83740:

    # "Woman" "Do I look like I would be interested in talking to some rando that walks up to me in a café?"
    "Woman" "Ti sembro una che sarebbe interessata a parlare con uno sconosciuto che mi si avvicina in un bar?"

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat0.rpy:19
translate italian cafechat0_3d85290d:

    # "Woman" "Go on. Leave me alone."
    "Woman" "Vattene. Lasciami in pace."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat0.rpy:20
translate italian cafechat0_4f0c7c77:

    # pc "Right, sorry."
    pc "Va bene, scusa."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat0.rpy:22
translate italian cafechat0_42bd03ba:

    # "I walk away and don't bother her anymore."
    "Me ne vado e non la disturbo più."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat0.rpy:23
translate italian cafechat0_888bf925:

    # "You would think that I would feel defeated after a rejection like that, but I don't."
    "Verrebbe da pensare che mi sentirei sconfitto dopo un rifiuto del genere, ma non è così."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat0.rpy:24
translate italian cafechat0_26026dae:

    # "I feel more confident actually. I had been rejected - harshly rejected - but I'm still alive. I can deal with it."
    "Anzi, mi sento più sicuro di me. Sono stato respinto – respinto senza mezzi termini – ma sono ancora vivo. Posso farcela."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat0.rpy:25
translate italian cafechat0_ed9a1144:

    # "I should try that again sometime, though hopefully with a nicer person."
    "Dovrei riprovarci qualche volta, sperando però in una persona più gentile."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat0.rpy:31
translate italian cafechat0_73e222e6:

    # "For now, I head to class."
    "Per ora, vado a lezione."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat0.rpy:34
translate italian cafechat0_fbe64787:

    # "For now, I head back to my car."
    "Per ora, torno alla mia auto."

